  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, point P(1,5) image of the point $P(1,5)$ about the line $y=x$ is $Q(5,1)$ and image of the point $Q$ on line $y=-x$ is $R(-1,-5)$\r\n$\\therefore$ Required circumcentre $=$ Mid-point of $P$ and $R$ $=\\left(\\frac{1-1}{2}, \\frac{5-5}{2}\\right)=(0,0$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2018_mat_a41.png\">",
